  "title": "Answer-Conditioned Chain-of-Thought Distillation for Industrial Vision with Small VLMs",
  "summary": "arXiv AI reports on answer-conditioned chain-of-thought (CoT) distillation for rapidly adapting small vision-language models (VLMs) to industrial tasks, while arXiv Computer Vision also discusses similar advancements. Both studies focus on improving tool choice and user alignment through memory conditioning.",
